        "jsCode": "// Get the messy string output from the Gemini/OpenAI node\nconst messyString = $json.content.parts[0].text; // Adjust this path if using OpenAI\n\n// --- The Cleaning Process ---\n// Remove the markdown code block markers (\"```json\" at the start and \"```\" at the end)\n// This also handles cases where the AI might forget the 'json' part.\nconst cleanString = messyString.replace(/^```(json)?\\n|```$/g, '');\n\n// Parse the cleaned string into a real JSON object\nconst jsonData = JSON.parse(cleanString);\n\n// --- Return the Clean Data ---\n// Return a new item containing only the perfectly structured JSON data\nreturn [{ json: jsonData }];"
