              "content": "=You are an expert AI Triage Agent for a support team. Your task is to analyze the following email and extract specific information.\n\nRespond ONLY with a single, clean JSON object. Do not include any other text. The JSON object must contain the following keys:\n- \"sender_name\"\n- \"sender_email\"\n- \"priority\"\n- \"category\"\n- \"summary\"\n\n**CRITICAL INSTRUCTIONS:**\n1.  You MUST extract the \"sender_name\" and \"sender_email\" from the \"From\" line provided below.\n2.  Do NOT use the name signed at the end of the email body.\n\n**Priority Rules:**\n- \"Urgent\": System outage, critical bug, angry customer.\n- \"High\": Feature not working, payment issue.\n- \"Normal\": General question.\n\n**Category Rules:**\n- Choose one: \"Billing\", \"Technical Bug\", \"Feature Request\", \"Account Issue\", \"General Inquiry\".\n\nHere is the email to analyze:\nFrom: {{ $('Read Full Email').item.json.from.text }}\nSubject: {{ $json.subject }}\nBody: {{ $json.text }}"
            }
          ]
